   "source": [
    "## Train test split\n",
    "- Train-test split is done chronologically to simulate a production pipeline where the orders in the latest 30 days of the train-test period will serve as the test set and the orders before that will be the train set\n",
    "- Check class imbalance\n",
    "\n",
    "Development training excludes the 45 approval days before the historical holdout. Training outcomes must already be known at holdout start. The later monthly backtest remains separate.\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
