                                        "## Check label availability\n",
                                        "- This section serves as a label availability check during each training run in production\n",
                                        "- It does not filter rows or replace existing targets yet\n",
                                        "- Use label_as_of_run from the audit for binary training labels at this run timestamp"
                              ]
                    },
                    {
